	<div class="fl-module-content fl-node-content">
		
<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Autobarn… Harcourts… Harley Davidson… Century
21… Ray White… IGA… Hertz… Mitre Ten… Ultra-Tune… and Ella Bache.</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">These are just some of the leading BRANDS who use <strong><a href="/ad-on-hold/">Ad On Hold</a>.</strong> <em>Shouldn’t you?</em> And you don’t have to be big, we have tens of thousands of small businesses who use our &#8216;Messages on Hold’ service to their advantage. </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">But we offer MORE… than just a simple ‘Message On Hold!’ Ad On Hold offers your business
so many great additional benefits.</p>



<ul class="wp-block-list"><li>It’s a
highly effective advertising and marketing tool, that will promote your
products and services 24/7.</li><li>It’s a
great way to engage potential customers, and educate them about your business. </li><li>It’s
cost-effective.</li><li>It
will turn potential customers into actual sales. </li><li>It’s professionally
written and recorded.</li><li>It
will make you sound like you’re one of the BIG BOYS&#8230; and give the caller
confidence that <em>your business&#8230; means
business!</em> </li></ul>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Offering powerful marketing solutions, our ‘Messages On Hold’ products will help ensure your MESSAGE IS HEARD. Our marketing and advertising professionals will work with you to create highly effective campaigns to drive sales. </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Would you like to know more about <a href="/">Ad On Hold?</a> </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Call our friendly sales team on (07) 5586 1400, and we’ll
show you how your business can directly benefit. </p>
